{"id": "JAH-SIG-AICOORDI-000001", "slug": "tool-ai-coordinator-signature", "title": "AI Coordinator \u2014 Overview and definition", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 1, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Selects and coordinates appropriate models, databases, programs, and tools to complete a user request. The AI Coordinator is the conductor: it takes a user request, interprets the goal, picks the right tools from the registry, orders them into a plan, runs the plan, verifies the result, and reports back. It is the component that turns 100 separate tools into one capable system, enforcing permissions and budgets at every step.", "capabilities": ["Request interpretation into goals", "Tool selection from the registry", "Plan construction and execution", "Permission and budget enforcement", "Result verification and reporting"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Tool overview and capability inventory", "code": "J({tool:TOOL.name,capabilities:TOOL.capabilities,count:TOOL.capabilities.length});assert(TOOL.capabilities.length>=5,'caps');", "verified_output": "{\"tool\":\"AI Coordinator\",\"capabilities\":[\"Request interpretation into goals\",\"Tool selection from the registry\",\"Plan construction and execution\",\"Permission and budget enforcement\",\"Result verification and reporting\"],\"count\":5}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-basic-pc-ai-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH AI Coordinator Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Plugin and Tool Registry", "Task Planner", "Result Verification Tool"], "sibling_edition": "tool-ai-coordinator"}}
{"id": "JAH-SIG-AICOORDI-000002", "slug": "tool-ai-coordinator-signature", "title": "AI Coordinator \u2014 Input and output contract", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 3, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Inputs: User request, tool registry, budgets. Outputs: Completed result with the plan trace.", "capabilities": ["Request interpretation into goals", "Tool selection from the registry", "Plan construction and execution", "Permission and budget enforcement", "Result verification and reporting"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Input/output contract validation", "code": "const req={prompt:'sunset',size:'1024x1024',seed:42};const ok=req.prompt.length>0&&req.seed>=0;J({valid:!!ok});assert(ok,'contract');", "verified_output": "{\"valid\":true}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-basic-pc-ai-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH AI Coordinator Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Plugin and Tool Registry", "Task Planner", "Result Verification Tool"], "sibling_edition": "tool-ai-coordinator"}}
{"id": "JAH-SIG-AICOORDI-000003", "slug": "tool-ai-coordinator-signature", "title": "AI Coordinator \u2014 Core capabilities", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 5, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Capabilities: Request interpretation into goals; Tool selection from the registry; Plan construction and execution; Permission and budget enforcement; Result verification and reporting.", "capabilities": ["Request interpretation into goals", "Tool selection from the registry", "Plan construction and execution", "Permission and budget enforcement", "Result verification and reporting"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Core operation executed", "code": "const W=4,H=4,px=[];for(let y=0;y<H;y++)for(let x=0;x<W;x++)px.push([x*64,y*64,128]);const avg=px[0].map((_,i)=>Math.round(px.reduce((a,p)=>a+p[i],0)/px.length));J({w:W,h:H,pixels:px.length,avgColor:avg});assert(px.length===16,'image');", "verified_output": "{\"w\":4,\"h\":4,\"pixels\":16,\"avgColor\":[96,96,128]}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-basic-pc-ai-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH AI Coordinator Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Plugin and Tool Registry", "Task Planner", "Result Verification Tool"], "sibling_edition": "tool-ai-coordinator"}}
{"id": "JAH-SIG-AICOORDI-000004", "slug": "tool-ai-coordinator-signature", "title": "AI Coordinator \u2014 Worked example", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 7, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Handle 'summarize this PDF and email the summary': pick reader, summarizer, and mail tools; run in order; verify each step.", "capabilities": ["Request interpretation into goals", "Tool selection from the registry", "Plan construction and execution", "Permission and budget enforcement", "Result verification and reporting"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Worked example end to end", "code": "const data=[{day:1,errors:3},{day:2,errors:5},{day:3,errors:2}];const total=data.reduce((a,d)=>a+d.errors,0);const md='# Weekly Report\\n\\n| day | errors |\\n|---|---|\\n'+data.map(d=>`| ${d.day} | ${d.errors} |`).join('\\n')+`\\n\\nTotal errors: ${total}.`;J({total,lines:md.split('\\n').length});assert(total===10,'report');", "verified_output": "{\"total\":10,\"lines\":9}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-basic-pc-ai-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH AI Coordinator Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Plugin and Tool Registry", "Task Planner", "Result Verification Tool"], "sibling_edition": "tool-ai-coordinator"}}
{"id": "JAH-SIG-AICOORDI-000005", "slug": "tool-ai-coordinator-signature", "title": "AI Coordinator \u2014 Safety, limits, and failure modes", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 9, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Bounded by the tools actually registered; refuses tasks with no capable tool; budgets cap runaway plans.", "capabilities": ["Request interpretation into goals", "Tool selection from the registry", "Plan construction and execution", "Permission and budget enforcement", "Result verification and reporting"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Safety limits enforced", "code": "const BLOCKED=['weapon','attack'];function screen(p){return !BLOCKED.some(b=>p.includes(b));}const req={prompt:'a calm lake',seed:7};J({screened:screen(req.prompt),reproducible:req.seed===7});assert(screen(req.prompt),'policy');", "verified_output": "{\"screened\":true,\"reproducible\":true}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-basic-pc-ai-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH AI Coordinator Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Plugin and Tool Registry", "Task Planner", "Result Verification Tool"], "sibling_edition": "tool-ai-coordinator"}}
{"id": "JAH-SIG-AICOORDI-000006", "slug": "tool-ai-coordinator-signature", "title": "AI Coordinator \u2014 Beginner teaching exercise", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 2, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Start simple: identify the tool's single core action for AI Coordinator, run it once on a tiny input, and verify the output matches expectations before scaling up.", "capabilities": ["Request interpretation into goals", "Tool selection from the registry", "Plan construction and execution", "Permission and budget enforcement", "Result verification and reporting"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Teaching exercise: beginner", "code": "const reg=new Map();reg.set('summarizer',{inputs:['text'],needs:['none']});const found=[...reg.entries()].filter(([n,t])=>t.inputs.includes('text')).map(([n])=>n);J({found});assert(found[0]==='summarizer','registry');", "verified_output": "{\"found\":[\"summarizer\"]}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-basic-pc-ai-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH AI Coordinator Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Plugin and Tool Registry", "Task Planner", "Result Verification Tool"], "sibling_edition": "tool-ai-coordinator"}}
{"id": "JAH-SIG-AICOORDI-000007", "slug": "tool-ai-coordinator-signature", "title": "AI Coordinator \u2014 Advanced pattern", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "tool database record", "ladder_rank": 11, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature methods and framings developed for the JAH system, labeled Signature throughout. Advanced use of AI Coordinator composes it with neighboring tools: chain its output into the next tool, add verification checkpoints, and automate the sequence once the manual path is proven.", "capabilities": ["Request interpretation into goals", "Tool selection from the registry", "Plan construction and execution", "Permission and budget enforcement", "Result verification and reporting"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Advanced pattern: coordinator plan", "code": "const plan=[{tool:'reader',in:'doc.pdf'},{tool:'summarizer',in:'reader.out'},{tool:'mailer',in:'summarizer.out'}];const order=plan.map((s,i)=>`${i+1}.${s.tool}`).join(' -> ');J({order,steps:plan.length});assert(plan.length===3,'plan');", "verified_output": "{\"order\":\"1.reader -> 2.summarizer -> 3.mailer\",\"steps\":3}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "catalog-100-basic-pc-ai-tools-2026-10-21.txt", "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH AI Coordinator Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Plugin and Tool Registry", "Task Planner", "Result Verification Tool"], "sibling_edition": "tool-ai-coordinator"}}
